%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8a8e32e629c410a4c97867fa550435ab, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 43636948828160
    m_Localized: Movement Training {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828161
    m_Localized: Basic Shot {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828162
    m_Localized: Basic Attack Hits {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828163
    m_Localized: Enemy Projectiles Hit {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828164
    m_Localized: Projectile Interception {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828165
    m_Localized: Skill Evasion {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636948828166
    m_Localized: Dummy Destruction {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333461598208
    m_Localized: E.R.I.S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318464
    m_Localized: Verifying identity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318465
    m_Localized: Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>, Class K26, No mission in
      progress.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333520318466
    m_Localized: Significant findings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512768
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Amputation of the right upper limb, extensive burns
      extending from the face to the shoulder, and nervous system damage</color>
      have been detected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512769
    m_Localized: Access granted. Immediate first aid is highly recommended.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512770
    m_Localized: Do you have any additional requests?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4972079872663553
    m_Localized: Ion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512772
    m_Localized: ...R-2 Block, <color=#ddbd78>Cafe Vesper</color>. All video records
      around 17:33 today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512773
    m_Localized: Physical function recovery rate at 79%. Neural connection for the
      <color=#73f3ff>right prosthetic arm</color> has been completed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512774
    m_Localized: Per your request, the visual calibration function of the <color=#73f3ff>ARGUS
      tactical prosthetic eye</color> has been linked with the prosthetic arm's motion
      control system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512775
    m_Localized: Additionally, the <color=#73f3ff>AEGIS core interface</color> has
      been implanted into the nervous system. Upon completing <color=#73f3ff>adaptation
      training</color>, reaction speed and control precision are expected to improve
      beyond pre-loss levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512776
    m_Localized: What about the <color=#ddbd78>Vesper</color> data?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512777
    m_Localized: Most of the original records were lost due to the explosion, so
      data is being reconstructed from fragments remaining in nearby recording devices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512778
    m_Localized: As this is expected to take some time, it is recommended to <color=#73f3ff>proceed
      with adaptation training</color> while you wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512779
    m_Localized: Start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512780
    m_Localized: <color=#A8B2BC>[ R-2 Block Cafe Vesper. July 21st, 17:29:20 ]</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512781
    m_Localized: <color=#A8B2BC>[ Playing back the reconstructed recording media.
      ]</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512782
    m_Localized: "Dad, what\u2019s this box?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4972079872663552
    m_Localized: Father
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512784
    m_Localized: A patient I operated on this time gave it to me as a premium tea
      set <color=#ddbd78>to show gratitude</color>, so I brought it along since it's
      been a while since I've seen <color=#73f3ff>my daughter</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512785
    m_Localized: Is it really okay to just accept things like that from patients?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512786
    m_Localized: If we reject even their gratitude, a doctor's work would become
      too bleak, don't you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512787
    m_Localized: I spend hours covered in blood trying to save people... It's hard
      to understand what could possibly make people want to kill each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512788
    m_Localized: ...Ahem. Still, wouldn't it be fine if it's <color=#FF4C5C>someone
      who does terrible things who dies</color>? Just like a surgery cutting away
      a bad tumor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512789
    m_Localized: There is nothing you won't say in front of a doctor, <color=#73f3ff>my
      dear daughter</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512790
    m_Localized: But... yes. <color=#FF4C5C>Sometimes a surgery is indeed necessary</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512791
    m_Localized: However. When it comes to <color=#ddbd78>saving a person</color>,
      what's important is-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512792
    m_Localized: <color=#A8B2BC>[ The recording between 17:32:26 and 17:32:41 has
      been corrupted. ]</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512793
    m_Localized: <color=#ddbd78>...must.....it down... Do you understand?</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512794
    m_Localized: I don't really get it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512795
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>You're a smart girl</color>, so I believe you'll
      understand someday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512796
    m_Localized: Ah, I should try the <color=#ddbd78>tea I received as a gift</color>.
      I'm sure <color=#73f3ff>you</color> liked green tea-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512797
    m_Localized: <color=#A8B2BC>[ From 17:33:44 onwards, the recording media were
      destroyed by the explosion, and no data exists. ]</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512798
    m_Localized: ...I'm here, Dad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512799
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512800
    m_Localized: I wanted to be a good person too, just like you, Dad...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512801
    m_Localized: Even if it looked a bit different... I wanted to be someone who
      saves people...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512802
    m_Localized: I couldn't even protect my loving family... I...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512803
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>I want to make a world where good people don't get
      hurt anymore.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512804
    m_Localized: Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>, after investigating the
      Syndicate's data, I have finished analyzing the individuals who appear to
      be connected to the incident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512805
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Should I transmit the list of the next targets?</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512807
    m_Localized: But... yes. <color=#FF4C5C>Sometimes a surgery is indeed necessary</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512806
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512808
    m_Localized: However. When it comes to <color=#ddbd78>saving a person</color>,
      what's important is,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512809
    m_Localized: Not only <color=#FF4C5C>cutting away the bad tumor</color>, but
      putting down the knife and suturing the wound is also important.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512810
    m_Localized: I don't really get it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512811
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>You're a smart girl</color>, so I believe you'll
      understand someday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512812
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512813
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Should I transmit the list of the next targets?</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512814
    m_Localized: No...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512815
    m_Localized: Delete the list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512816
    m_Localized: ...Understood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512817
    m_Localized: Dad. I finally understand what you meant back then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512818
    m_Localized: That <color=#FF4C5C>cutting away the bad</color> isn't the end,
      but <color=#ddbd78>caring for the remaining wounds is also necessary</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512819
    m_Localized: I'm going to try and find a way to do that now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512820
    m_Localized: ...I'm leaving now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512821
    m_Localized: The video recording has ended. Please understand that while every
      effort was made to reconstruct it, some parts were lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512822
    m_Localized: ...This is enough. What is the source of the explosive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512823
    m_Localized: As a result of backtracking the distribution channel of the components
      found in the fragments, a sales record for items of the same lineage two days
      prior to the incident was confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512824
    m_Localized: The location is near <color=#ddbd78>M-8 Block</color>, in a closed
      subway <color=#ddbd78>black market</color>. The seller is <color=#ddbd78>the
      arms dealer Salvo</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512825
    m_Localized: The eccentric guy rumored to <color=#ddbd78>ride around on those
      guns</color>? What about the buyer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512826
    m_Localized: They used a pseudonym, making tracking difficult. As you know, due
      to the nature of <color=#ddbd78>unofficial missions</color>, there are heavy
      constraints on tracking targets whose identities are not clearly revealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512827
    m_Localized: Is it impossible even if we pay an additional fee?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512828
    m_Localized: It is impossible. It would be possible if you personally register
      it as an official mission, but it is not recommended as the likelihood of exposure
      to the target is high. Another way is...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512829
    m_Localized: I'll have to go directly to <color=#ddbd78>Salvo</color> and <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color>
      him to get the information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512830
    m_Localized: Information analysis would be possible if we only secure the data,
      are you truly going to <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color> him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512831
    m_Localized: That's more comfortable for me. Fewer loose ends. Besides, that
      guy has crossed the line far enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512832
    m_Localized: ...And I also happen to need someone to <color=#FF4C5C>take my anger
      out on</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512833
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Additionally, we have been able to identify the <color=#ddbd78>courier
      who delivered the explosive</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512834
    m_Localized: Who is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512835
    m_Localized: The individual is a <color=#ddbd78>bulky mercenary</color> named
      <color=#ddbd78>Ram</color>, and because they are equipped with <color=#ddbd78>high-output
      physical enhancement gear</color>, they were not difficult to identify.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512836
    m_Localized: However, similarly, we could not track down who commissioned them
      to move the explosive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512837
    m_Localized: I'll have to <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color> that guy directly as well.
      Do you know where he is currently located?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512838
    m_Localized: Please wait. I will <color=#73f3ff>register the relevant data on
      the panel</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512839
    m_Localized: Verifying identity. Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>. Welcome
      back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512840
    m_Localized: The data you acquired has already been nearly completely analyzed.
      Do you have any questions?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512841
    m_Localized: The purpose of the bomb's delivery. I want to know <color=#ddbd78>why
      my dad had to die</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512842
    m_Localized: The reason is simple. The <color=#FF4C5C>explosion at Vesper was
      an accident</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512843
    m_Localized: ...What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512844
    m_Localized: As a result of investigating <color=#ddbd78>Ram</color>'s terminal,
      the elimination target was the original recipient of the gift, meaning the
      <color=#ddbd78>patient your father was treating</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512845
    m_Localized: The individual is presumed to be an accountant for the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate</color>,
      an organization that manages the distribution of weapons, information, and
      funds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512846
    m_Localized: Circumstantially, the explosive being delivered to your father was
      an unplanned variable; originally, it appears they <color=#FF4C5C>intended
      to detonate it at the target's residence and disguise it as a gas accident</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512847
    m_Localized: Then... where is <color=#ddbd78>that person</color> now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512848
    m_Localized: The day after the Vesper incident, he was <color=#FF4C5C>found dead
      at home, apparently by suicide</color>. The distorted figure captured in nearby
      surveillance footage suggests that <color=#ddbd78>Mirage</color> <color=#FF4C5C>visited</color>
      him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512849
    m_Localized: <color=#ddbd78>Mirage</color>.. is it the <color=#ddbd78>one who
      disappears in front of you and suddenly appears and stabs you in the back</color>?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512850
    m_Localized: Although the estimated location of <color=#ddbd78>Mirage</color>
      currently registered in the database exists... please understand that it cannot
      be provided unless it is registered as an official mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512851
    m_Localized: No need for that. If I loiter around <color=#ddbd78>that accountant</color>'s
      house, he'll come to <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color> me on his own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512852
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Also, separately, we have identified some <color=#ddbd78>individuals
      connected to the incident</color> through <color=#ddbd78>Salvo</color>'s transaction
      history.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512853
    m_Localized: Must be people from the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate</color> side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512854
    m_Localized: Correct. The person who led the operation is <color=#ddbd78>Canon</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512855
    m_Localized: <color=#ddbd78>Canon</color>? That person belongs to the underworld?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512856
    m_Localized: Publicly, they active as an artist combining music and drone performances,
      but in reality, they appear to belong to the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512857
    m_Localized: Normally, the location of such a high-ranking executive would
      not be easy to pinpoint, but <color=#ddbd78>Canon</color> has a large public
      information footprint, so we were able to identify their location easily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512858
    m_Localized: However, since <color=#FF4C5C>we also</color> maintain a collaborative
      relationship with the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate</color>, it will be difficult
      to grant you accommodations if you <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color> the related
      individual without going through proper procedures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512859
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Will you still proceed?</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512860
    m_Localized: If I had cared about profits, I would have washed my hands of this,
      but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512861
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>This is a strictly personal revenge.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512862
    m_Localized: Confirmed. Before you depart, please check as we have <color=#73f3ff>expanded
      the available modules</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512863
    m_Localized: Verifying identity. Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>. Welcome
      back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512864
    m_Localized: There are two pieces of information that have currently been analyzed.
      Borrowing an idiomatic expression, it is good news and bad news. Which side
      would you like to hear first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512865
    m_Localized: ...Tell me one by one. I'll judge after I listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512866
    m_Localized: First, after analyzing the devices of those who were commissioned,
      we were able to pinpoint the location of the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate headquarters</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512867
    m_Localized: And the bad news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512868
    m_Localized: Recently, a new mission was registered under the name of the client,
      the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate</color>. <color=#FF4C5C>Visitor</color> Code name
      <color=#ddbd78>Echo</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512869
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>The target of the visit</color>. Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>,
      it is you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512870
    m_Localized: <color=#ddbd78>Those bastards</color> must have caught the scent.
      <color=#ddbd78>Echo</color>... Of all people, they brought in the most troublesome
      one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512871
    m_Localized: By the way, <color=#73f3ff>E.R.I.S.</color>. If it has been designated
      as an official mission, you have no reason to take my side anymore, so why
      are you informing me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512872
    m_Localized: To explain it simply, it is a sort of investment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512873
    m_Localized: An investment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512874
    m_Localized: As you know, we adjust the balance of society through <color=#FF4C5C>visits</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512875
    m_Localized: However, <color=#ddbd78>those who move according to profit</color>
      are bound to have their judgment clouded and eventually become corrupt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512876
    m_Localized: On the other hand, those who move with a <color=#FF4C5C>consistent
      motivation</color> as their driving force rather than profit become a pure
      and predictable engine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512877
    m_Localized: Therefore, it is judged that helping you, <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color>,
      to continue your <color=#FF4C5C>visits</color> is beneficial to society as
      a whole.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512878
    m_Localized: ...I see. Then to what extent can you support me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512879
    m_Localized: The location of the <color=#ddbd78>Syndicate headquarters</color>
      has been <color=#73f3ff>registered on the panel</color>. Before Code name
      <color=#ddbd78>Echo</color> arrives, I recommend that you <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color>
      it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512880
    m_Localized: The locations of the individuals whose identities have been specified
      have been <color=#73f3ff>registered on the tactical panel</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512881
    m_Localized: Through the <color=#73f3ff>tactical panel</color>, you can <color=#73f3ff>check
      the target's information</color> and <color=#73f3ff>move to the corresponding
      location</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512882
    m_Localized: When you <color=#73f3ff>access the panel</color>, the following
      interface will be displayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512883
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Visit</color> the desired target and secure the data.
      As soon as valid data is secured, we will analyze it immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512884
    m_Localized: Even if it is a target you have already completed a <color=#FF4C5C>visit</color>
      to, it is possible to <color=#73f3ff>record that individual's data and engage
      in battle repeatedly</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512885
    m_Localized: If you <color=#73f3ff>achieve additional conditions</color>, you
      can <color=#73f3ff>secure more battle data</color> in addition to the incident
      data to be analyzed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512886
    m_Localized: Since the <color=#73f3ff>collected data chips</color> are subsequently
      used for <color=#73f3ff>module expansion that improves equipment performance</color>,
      it is recommended to <color=#73f3ff>prioritize securing data chips if the
      battle is challenging</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512887
    m_Localized: Now that you have secured a certain amount of <color=#73f3ff>data
      chips</color>, I will explain the <color=#73f3ff>module expansion function</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512888
    m_Localized: By <color=#73f3ff>accessing the corresponding module panel</color>,
      you can <color=#73f3ff>improve the performance of your implanted equipment</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512889
    m_Localized: When you <color=#73f3ff>access the panel</color>, the following
      interface will be displayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512890
    m_Localized: You can <color=#73f3ff>consume the data chips you possess</color>
      to <color=#73f3ff>expand and equip the modules you want</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333524512891
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>Expanded modules can be changed freely</color>, but
      please note that <color=#FF4C5C>modules of the same type cannot be equipped
      duplicate</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333528707072
    m_Localized: You can also <color=#73f3ff>refund selected modules back into data
      chips</color>, so if a <color=#73f3ff>battle is challenging, it is recommended
      to utilize various module combinations</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901376
    m_Localized: Commencing <color=#73f3ff>equipment adaptation training</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901377
    m_Localized: First, we will verify whether the equipment implantation has caused
      any adverse effects on your nervous system. <color=#73f3ff>Please move forward.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901378
    m_Localized: Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901379
    m_Localized: Press the <sprite name="icon_w"><sprite name="icon_a"><sprite name="icon_s"><sprite
      name="icon_d"> keys to <color=#73f3ff>move.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901380
    m_Localized: Movement normal. No significant findings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901381
    m_Localized: Next, we will measure the impact of momentary shock. <color=#73f3ff>Please
      fire the gun held in your left hand.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901382
    m_Localized: Basic Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901383
    m_Localized: <sprite name="icon_leftclick"> to <color=#73f3ff>fire a bullet-type
      energy core in the direction of the cursor.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901384
    m_Localized: Recoil control and posture calibration normal. No abnormalities
      in the physical balance system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901385
    m_Localized: Opening the front bulkhead. Please advance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901386
    m_Localized: Next is <color=#73f3ff>adaptation training utilizing dummy targets</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901387
    m_Localized: First, let's test a <color=#73f3ff>module that automatically calibrates
      its aim to adversarial objects</color>. <color=#73f3ff>Shoot anywhere.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901388
    m_Localized: Aim calibration module normal. <color=#73f3ff>This module can be
      removed later if it becomes unnecessary.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901389
    m_Localized: Next, we will verify the <color=#73f3ff>AEGIS interface's operation</color>
      using the dummy's suppressive fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901390
    m_Localized: Wait, I just had surgery?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901391
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>The AEGIS system is an important function that consumes
      the core at the time of attack to momentarily block fatal damage</color>, and
      we will check it in advance for safety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901392
    m_Localized: Taking Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901393
    m_Localized: 'When hit by an enemy attack, <color=#73f3ff>a bullet-type energy
      core is consumed first to absorb the damage.</color>

      

      <color=#FF4C5C>If
      you take damage while possessing zero cores, it will result in death.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901394
    m_Localized: AEGIS system normal. Please note that while physical damage can
      be neutralized, the shock and pain cannot be mitigated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901395
    m_Localized: I know...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901396
    m_Localized: Additionally, please be extremely cautious, as the AEGIS system
      will not function if <color=#FF4C5C>there are no bullet-type energy cores available
      to block the attack</color>, which may result in <color=#FF4C5C>fatal injury</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901397
    m_Localized: Next is <color=#73f3ff>training utilizing the ARGUS tactical prosthetic
      eye and the prosthetic arm's motion control system</color>. Try to intercept
      the <color=#73f3ff>bullets fired by the dummy</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901398
    m_Localized: Interception
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901399
    m_Localized: '<sprite name="icon_rightclick"> to <color=#73f3ff>capture enemy
      projectiles with the ARGUS eye, allowing your prosthetic arm to automatically
      intercept them.</color>

      

      <color=#73f3ff>A successful intercept
      neutralizes the attack and automatically absorbs its energy into the core.</color>

      

      <color=#FF4C5C>Failing
      multiple intercepts in a short time</color> strains the ARGUS eye, <color=#FF4C5C>gradually
      reducing its capture range.</color>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901400
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>Intercepting is the only way to replenish bullet-type
      energy cores during combat.</color> Please note that some projectiles cannot
      be intercepted depending on their type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901401
    m_Localized: Next is the explanation regarding <color=#73f3ff>Overload</color>.
      Energy cores continuously release energy to maintain the AEGIS system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901403
    m_Localized: Overload
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901404
    m_Localized: 'Bullet-type energy cores will <color=#73f3ff>overload and be automatically
      discharged if held for too long.</color>

      

      The ammo icon in
      the magazine indicates the time remaining until overload.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901405
    m_Localized: Next is <color=#73f3ff>Active Skill</color>. You can recycle a portion
      of the energy released by the core to use it as a <color=#73f3ff>momentary
      enhancement of physical capability</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901406
    m_Localized: Active Skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901407
    m_Localized: 'Press the <sprite name="icon_space"> to <color=#73f3ff>use a active
      skill.</color>

      

      <color=#73f3ff>Active Skills have a cooldown</color>
      and can be used again after a certain time.

      

      The <color=#73f3ff>skill
      gauge around the magazine</color> indicates when the skill is ready to use.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901408
    m_Localized: Try to dodge the enemy attack using the <color=#73f3ff>Tactical
      Dodge skill</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901409
    m_Localized: The basic training for the implanted equipment has concluded. Lastly,
      we will conduct a <color=#73f3ff>mock battle with an enemy dummy</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901410
    m_Localized: Utilize <color=#73f3ff>attack, interception, and active skill</color>
      appropriately to <color=#73f3ff>destroy the dummy.</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901411
    m_Localized: Adaptation training concluded. Information updated. Adjusting the
      physical capability information of Code name <color=#73f3ff>Ion</color> upward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901412
    m_Localized: The data analysis related to <color=#ddbd78>Cafe Vesper</color>
      is 98% complete. Please return to the lobby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901413
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>Tactical dodge failed.</color> Please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901414
    m_Localized: Perform the tactical dodge right before making contact with the
      bullet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901415
    m_Localized: <color=#FF4C5C>All bullet-type energy cores have been depleted</color>;
      resupplying now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 43636894302208
    m_Localized: They probably already know I'm coming and are waiting for me along
      with <color=#ddbd78>Echo</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5333532901402
    m_Localized: If the same core is <color=#FF4C5C>not consumed for a long time,
      it will overload</color> and be <color=#FF4C5C>automatically discharged</color>,
      as it can inflict thermal damage to the user.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 739306561925120
    m_Localized: In addition, the <color=#73f3ff>bullet-type energy core displayed
      on the magazine is consumed</color> when shooting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1108486769008640
    m_Localized: '[ Objective ]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1345961062363136
    m_Localized: That's a reasonable guess, then I recommend you <color=#73f3ff>check
      the module</color> for the last time before combat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1424586970947584
    m_Localized: However, the reason they were designated as an elimination target
      has not been confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406394068992
    m_Localized: Counter {0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789248
    m_Localized: Lastly, this is <color=#73f3ff>Counter</color> training.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789249
    m_Localized: When an enemy prepares <color=#FF4C5C>certain powerful attacks</color>,
      the <color=#73f3ff>ARGUS tactical prosthetic eye may detect a vulnerable energy
      core</color>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789250
    m_Localized: <color=#73f3ff>Intercepting that core</color> will not only <color=#73f3ff>stun
      the enemy but also generate extra energy</color>, so utilizing this can lead
      the battle to your advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789251
    m_Localized: Counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1826406452789252
    m_Localized: 'When an enemy prepares <color=#FF4C5C>certain powerful attacks</color>,
      the <color=#73f3ff>ARGUS tactical prosthetic eye detects a vulnerable blue
      energy core</color>.

      

      When you <color=#73f3ff>intercept that core</color>, <color=#73f3ff>the enemy
      is stunned and extra energy is generated nearby</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2147990514270208
    m_Localized: Training Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
